      "grader_score": 2,
      "grader_notes": "The agent spelled the unit out as \"D O W N S T A I R S\", asked for a gate code or buzzer after the caller had already said to ring the downstairs bell, and asked to put the visit under an account it already knew. The confirmation never acted on the bell note or on the caller's request that the technician call before any extra work, so the caller felt unheard.",
      "reply_delay_p50_ms": 962.1599170495756,
